(Configuration checklist) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Twelve checks before a pilot number takes real traffic.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instance: Region chosen on purpose. Logging on. Storage bucket and key named.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Identity: SAML assertion carries routing profile, security profile, and role. Test one user.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Numbers: One pilot DID before a port. Caller ID on the queue is a number you may present.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Hours: Queue time zone, not the tester's laptop. Holiday override for the next closure.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Flows: Error, timeout, and default branches connected. Invoke module for the checks you) Tj
T* (repeat.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Lambda: Associated with the instance. Resource policy allows connect.amazonaws.com. Returns) Tj
T* (inside 8 seconds.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Lex: Alias associated. Speech and DTMF both tested. Fallback reaches a person.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Routing: Primary profile priority 1 and delay 0. Overflow has a higher number and a delay.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Recording: Set recording behavior, then confirm one object landed. KMS key policy trusts the) Tj
T* (service role.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Streams: Agent events and CTRs have a consumer that tolerates duplicates and joins on) Tj
T* (ContactId.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Network: Endpoint Connectivity tool from an agent PC. Error rate under 2 percent.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (E911: Validated address on the agent profile. 933 readback. Security task on a real 911.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Sources and go deeper) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (What is Connect Customer? - Amazon Connect Customer \(AWS docs\)) Tj
T* (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/connect/latest/adminguide/what-is-amazon-connect.html last) Tj
T* (checked 2026-10) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (RFC 3261: SIP: Session Initiation Protocol | RFC Editor \(RFC\)) Tj
T* (https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3261/ last checked 2026-10) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Troubleshoot contact flow errors in Amazon Connect | AWS re:Post \(community\)) Tj
T* (https://repost.aws/knowledge-center/connect-contact-flow-errors last checked 2026-10) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (AWS History and Timeline regarding Amazon Connect - Overview, Functions, Features, Summary) Tj
T* (of Updates, and Introduction to Amazon Connect Customer | hidekazu-ko \(community\)) Tj
